        "text": "It worked. Whatever you took did precisely what he said it would do, on the schedule he gave you. So he is back, with a larger wagon and a better offer — better terms than the first, not worse — because a settlement already written in the book is worth considerably more to him than one that is not. Taking it is obviously the correct decision. There is nothing hidden in it anywhere."
