        "recipient": null,
        "text": "Your clerk gets a look at the open book while it is being packed, and what he sees is not an account of your settlement. It is an account of forty of them — who is solvent, who is short, who came through last winter on borrowed stores and will take any terms offered by spring. The Versari know the state of this continent settlement by settlement, in one hand, in one book, and not one of those settlements knows it about the others."
