        "text": "The first run comes off and it is plate, stock and fittings of a grade nothing in your holdings can produce and nothing you can buy within a season's travel. The foreman will trade it, and what she needs is specific: hands, food for forty and rising, and safe passage for the hauls going east. Every one of those is a real cost to you. The goods are worth it, which is the part that makes this difficult."
